WEBVTT

00:17:58.942 --> 00:18:00.268
We're able to talk about it

00:18:00.292 --> 00:18:02.482
because it doesn't come
into the classroom.

00:18:02.855 --> 00:18:04.361
Another important condition

00:18:04.385 --> 00:18:06.887
is I don't make
my black students responsible

00:18:06.911 --> 00:18:09.688
for teaching their classmates about this.

00:18:09.712 --> 00:18:11.021
That is my job.

00:18:11.323 --> 00:18:12.720
So I come prepared.

00:18:13.188 --> 00:18:16.770
I hold the conversation with a tight rein,

00:18:16.794 --> 00:18:19.998
and I'm armed with
knowledge of the history.

00:18:20.022 --> 00:18:24.228
I always ask students the same question:

00:18:24.252 --> 00:18:27.529
Why is talking about the N-word hard?

00:18:28.165 --> 00:18:30.609
Their answers are amazing.